1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,000
(Leonard:)Sheldon, why?

2
00:00:02,167 --> 00:00:04,707
(Sheldon:)You see, while Leo would not
have gone into rehab...

3
00:00:04,878 --> 00:00:08,878
(Sheldon:)...it is completely plausible that we would
have talked him into leaving the motel...

4
00:00:09,049 --> 00:00:11,219
(Sheldon:)- ...and coming home with us.
- Oh...

5
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,550
(Toby:)Sheldon, how about this
as my motivation?

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,890
When I was 14 years old...

7
00:00:15,055 --> 00:00:19,105
(Toby:)...I was abused in the Philippines
by a clubfooted Navy chaplain.

8
00:00:20,686 --> 00:00:24,066
(Sheldon:)No, we're going with middle child
and a genetic predisposition...

9
00:00:24,231 --> 00:00:26,731
(Sheldon:)...to inadequate serotonin production.

10
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,690
Swell, well, how do I play
genetic predisposition?

11
00:00:30,862 --> 00:00:33,032
(Sheldon:)Subtextually, of course.

12
00:00:33,865 --> 00:00:35,405
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

13
00:00:36,076 --> 00:00:38,246
(Sheldon:)Just have fun with it.

14
00:00:43,083 --> 00:00:45,623
- Morning, Penny.
- Hi. How did the intervention go?

15
00:00:45,794 --> 00:00:48,714
(Sheldon:)Unfortunately, we weren't able
to convince him to go to rehab.

16
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:52,090
(Penny:)Well, based on what you told me,
I'm not surprised.

17
00:00:54,553 --> 00:00:57,093
(Sheldon:)But we did convince him
to leave the motel.

18
00:00:57,264 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon:)Come say hello.

